                                                        <span>
                                                            <span class="dm-v4-collapse__title">AI interview question sets <span class="dm-v4-collapse__count" id="dmV4QuestionSetsCount"></span></span>
                                                            <span class="dm-v4-collapse__sub">Balanced papers, one question per rubric parameter. Each interview is locked to one set, so no two candidates in a batch answer the same paper.</span>
                                                        </span>
                                                    </span>
                                                    <i class="fa fa-chevron-down dm-v4-collapse__chev" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                                </button>
                                                <div class="dm-v4-collapse__body" id="dmV4QuestionSetsPanel" hidden data-irf-id="@Model.id">
